WEBVTT

00:06:27.844 --> 00:06:30.494
Put PB is different.

00:06:30.876 --> 00:06:32.176
When we started doing PB,

00:06:32.200 --> 00:06:35.437
I met amazing young leaders
across the city.

00:06:35.961 --> 00:06:40.017
One in particular, a rock star,
Malachi Hernandez,

00:06:40.041 --> 00:06:41.485
15 years old,

00:06:41.509 --> 00:06:43.111
came into a community meeting --

00:06:43.135 --> 00:06:46.180
shy, curious, a little quiet.

00:06:46.204 --> 00:06:47.704
Stuck around

00:06:47.728 --> 00:06:50.656
and became one of the young people
hoping to lead the project.

00:06:50.680 --> 00:06:53.220
Now fast-forward a couple of years.

00:06:53.561 --> 00:06:57.910
Malachi was the first in his family
to attend college.

00:06:57.934 --> 00:06:59.283
A couple of weeks ago,

00:06:59.307 --> 00:07:02.569
he was the first
in his family to graduate.